bles Llama Stack management by default for\n  entitled clusters (no TP opt-in gate). Full coverage of this HLR.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41037,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9cfc5b8eb1cc258d","agent_id":"ae0701df2f2f4057e","session_id":"a5ccff59-e83b-4c36-b1be-14c65ff6e583","uuid":"b0f97a41-55ea-4d82-88d6-9d9379e3d9de","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:49:38.285Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9014"}
