rt\n50\t  conventions and get them ratified by the owning team and support\n51\t  stakeholders.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- A documented SLO target set exists for the supported distribution surface,\n56\t  reviewed and accepted by the owning team and support stakeholders.\n57\t- A backport policy document exists stating supported release lines, backport\n58\t  criteria, and request/delivery process.\n59\t- A supported configuration matrix exists enumerating the configurations and\n60\t  provider integrations supported at GA, with unsupported combinations\n61\t  explicitly marked.\n62\t- The three posture artifacts are published where support and customers can\n63\t  reference them, and consistent with one another (no SLO or backport claim\n64\t  contradicting the configuration matrix).\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- **HLR-3 (P0)**: Production support posture is in place — documented SLO\n69\t  targets, backport policy, and supported configuration matrix. Full coverage\n70\t  of this HLR.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a709942beeffec84","agent_id":"a7da80d2ef26e8f00","session_id":"a5ccff59-e83b-4c36-b1be-14c65ff6e583","uuid":"886004fb-996f-4308-8e98-2b2275cbd5e5","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:52:21.600Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b06db2842f850cc3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
