hboard tests covering the default-on entitlement path and the\n50\t  non-entitled path.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- On an entitled cluster with no explicit opt-in configuration, Llama Stack\n55\t  management surfaces are available in the Dashboard by default.\n56\t- On a non-entitled cluster, Llama Stack management is not surfaced by\n57\t  default (existing behavior preserved).\n58\t- Automated Dashboard tests cover both the entitled default-enabled path and\n59\t  the non-entitled path, and pass.\n60\t- No TP opt-in gate remains in the Dashboard's Llama Stack enablement path.\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- **HLR-5 (P1)**: The Dashboard enables Llama Stack management by default for\n65\t  entitled clusters (no TP opt-in gate). Full coverage of this HLR.\n66\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a709942beeffec84","agent_id":"a7da80d2ef26e8f00","session_id":"a5ccff59-e83b-4c36-b1be-14c65ff6e583","uuid":"fa0177b5-e66d-43a6-a54f-611fadd49f74","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:52:24.792Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-aafeeb659d61ba5b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
