eature development beyond GA-bar quality work\n41\t- Deprecating alternative GenAI serving paths\n42\t\n43\t## Open Questions\n44\t\n45\t1. The GA scope itself depends on HLR-1's assessment — until it lands, the\n46\t   size of the stability and hardening work is an estimate.\n47\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b7df2bc2f05c9eb","agent_id":"a0d42e19ed088d994","session_id":"a5ccff59-e83b-4c36-b1be-14c65ff6e583","uuid":"12b9e6bb-1a45-4615-9cde-6d26a118fac5","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:55:36.365Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-96230b45241de4a0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
